From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Configure the C library and scanner without a C++ toolchain

The packaged library and CLI are C. Unit tests are disabled for the target.
Do not require an unused C++ compiler in a minimal Buildroot image.

Upstream: not submitted
Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 9633d1a..9491bdf 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
 #
 cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.10.2)
 
-project(XbSymbolDatabase)
+project(XbSymbolDatabase LANGUAGES C)
 
 # Enforce warnings as errors to verify projects are in sync and doesn't have hidden warnings.
 if(${CMAKE_VERSION} VERSION_LESS "3.24.0")
